{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill is published in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SKILL.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-patterns.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"code":"AppStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Installing the skill","anchor":"Installing-the-skill","level":2},{"type":"heading","text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Requires ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gh"},{"text":" ≥ v2.90.0 (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["gh skill install heirloomlogic\/skills swidux-ref --agent claude-code --scope user"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"--scope user","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" installs to "},{"code":"~\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (loads in every project)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--scope project"},{"type":"text","text":" installs to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<cwd>\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/"},{"type":"text","text":" (commit it so the whole team gets it)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pin a version with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref@v1.2.3"},{"text":". List tags with ","type":"text"},{"code":"git ls-remote --tags https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Other agents: pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--agent codex"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--agent cursor"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"--agent gemini-cli","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", etc. Run "},{"code":"gh skill install --help","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for the full list."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"skills.sh","anchor":"skillssh","level":3},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["npx skillsadd heirloomlogic\/skills"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indexes the same source repo. Works without a GitHub CLI install."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Manual (no `gh`, no `npx`)","anchor":"Manual-no-gh-no-npx","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Claude Code uses ","type":"text"},{"code":".claude\/skills\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and others use ","type":"text"},{"code":".agents\/skills\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Pick the directory that matches your agent:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["# Claude Code — project install","mkdir -p .claude\/skills && \\","  curl -fsSL https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/archive\/refs\/heads\/main.tar.gz | \\","  tar -xz --strip-components=2 -C .claude\/skills skills-main\/swidux-ref","","# Codex \/ Cursor \/ Gemini CLI — project install","mkdir -p .agents\/skills && \\","  curl -fsSL https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/archive\/refs\/heads\/main.tar.gz | \\","  tar -xz --strip-components=2 -C .agents\/skills skills-main\/swidux-ref"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swap "},{"code":".claude\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":".agents\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"code":"~\/.claude\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" etc. for a user-wide install. "},{"code":"tar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" overwrites by default, so re-running either command updates the skill in place. To pin a version, replace "},{"code":"main","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the URL with the tag name (e.g. "},{"code":"swidux-ref@v1.0.0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Loading content directly (assistants without a skill loader)","anchor":"Loading-content-directly-assistants-without-a-skill-loader","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The skill files are plain Markdown. Point your assistant’s system prompt or rules file at:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/raw.githubusercontent.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/main\/swidux-ref\/SKILL.md"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/raw.githubusercontent.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/main\/swidux-ref\/swidux-patterns.md"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"What it helps w